// SDR email templates — extracted verbatim from the n8n SDR Automation workflow
// (workflow id pcUKAkMkvoKQ4kPY, "Build Future Email Activities" node).
//
// Phase 3 architecture shift: Apollo sequences own the cadence/timing.
// The Day-0 template here becomes the FIRST draft generated by our backend
// for human approval. Subsequent steps (day 3 / day 6) live INSIDE the Apollo
// sequence as configured by Derek in Apollo's UI — not generated by us.
//
// PB is single-touch (no follow-up); the other three triggers have follow-ups
// stored here only for reference and parity with the legacy n8n flow.
//
// Merge fields:
//   {First}  — contact's first name
//   {ENV}    — env program acronym (default "EPA")
//   {SWPPP}  — SWPPP program acronym (default "SWPPP")
//   {Sig}    — sender's signature (the renderer auto-appends "\nwww.ProSWPPP.com")

